          </div>
          <ol class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-2 list-decimal pl-5 leading-relaxed">
            <li>Paste your bridge token in <strong>Account / Auth</strong>. The header pill goes green when your instance answers, and the preview banner disappears.</li>
            <li>Set your gates in <strong>Section 04</strong> and sync them. Stay at 0.5% risk per trade until you have a sample of your own fills.</li>
            <li>Choose the timeframe and the symbols the desk may trade in the <strong>Live Desk Profile</strong>.</li>
            <li>Read the signal feed, then route your own ticket with a stop attached. No stop, no trade.</li>
            <li>Review the blotter and the bridge audit log after every session. The log is the honest version of your day.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>
