          </div>

          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            The token is kept in this browser only and sent to your own instance, never to ours.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-2">
          <button type="button" onclick="unpairBridge()" class="btn-secondary-glass px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono text-rose-300 hover:border-rose-500">
